    <bpmn:process id="W_W1733" name="W1733. Whistleblower &amp; Ethics Reporting Channel Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual policy review; report received through ethics channel
Frequency: Continuous channel availability; ~20–40 reports/year expected
Volume: ~20–40 ethics reports/year
Owner: Head of Internal Audit
Participants: Head of Internal Audit, Corporate Secretary, Legal Counsel, HR, accused party&#x27;s supervisor
Source: workflow W1733 — Whistleblower &amp; Ethics Reporting Channel Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1733_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1733_Lane1" name="Head of Internal Audit">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1733_Lane2" name="Investigator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1733_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1733_Start4" name="Annual policy review; report received through ethics channel">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1733_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1733_Task5" name="Maintain confidential ethics reporting channel: (a) toll-free hotline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain confidential ethics reporting channel: (a) toll-free hotline (outsourced to third-party provider for anonymity), (b) web-based reporting portal (encrypted, accessible to all 6,925 employees), (c) email to dedicated ethics mailbox, (d) physical drop boxes at each store/DC/HQ, (e) option for anonymous reporting in all channels
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit
Accountable (A): CEO / Audit Committee
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1733_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1733_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1733_Task6" name="Report received and triaged by Head of Internal Audit: (a) categorize: (i)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Report received and triaged by Head of Internal Audit: (a) categorize: (i) fraud/theft, (ii) harassment/discrimination, (iii) safety violation, (iv) policy violation, (v) conflict of interest, (vi) other, (b) assess severity: high (fraud &gt; PHP 100K, safety risk, senior management involved), medium (policy violation, smaller amounts), low (minor concern, suggestion), (c) assign investigator
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit
Accountable (A): CEO (high severity)
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1733_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1733_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1733_Task7" name="Investigation: (a) high severity: dedicated investigator, may engage external…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Investigation: (a) high severity: dedicated investigator, may engage external forensic team, report to Audit Committee, (b) medium: Internal Audit investigator, 30-day target resolution, (c) low: referred to department head for resolution, (d) all investigations documented, evidence preserved
Responsible (R): Investigator
Accountable (A): Head of Internal Audit
Duration: 1–30 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1733_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1733_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1733_Task8" name="Resolution and action: (a) substantiated: disciplinary action per HR policy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Resolution and action: (a) substantiated: disciplinary action per HR policy (warning, suspension, termination, legal referral), (b) unsubstantiated: case closed with documentation, (c) reporter protected from retaliation per whistleblower policy, (d) accused party informed of outcome and appeal rights
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit / HR / Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): CEO / Audit Committee
Duration: Variable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1733_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1733_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1733_Task9" name="Quarterly report to Audit Committee: (a) number of reports by category and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Quarterly report to Audit Committee: (a) number of reports by category and severity, (b) investigation outcomes, (c) action taken, (d) average resolution time, (e) trend analysis, (f) policy or process improvement recommendations
Responsible (R): Head of Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1733_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1733_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1733_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1733_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1733_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-231 (ensure corporate-governance compliance.) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Head of Internal Audit</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1733_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1733_Annotation11" targetRef="W1733_Start4" associationDirection="None" />
