    <bpmn:process id="W_W1734" name="W1734. Conflict of Interest Disclosure &amp; Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual disclosure requirement; new hire; triggered by specific situation
Frequency: Annual disclosure (~315 managers-and-above for full/detailed disclosure; ~6,925 employees for simplified acknowledgment)
Volume: ~315 detailed disclosures/year from managers and above; ~6,925 simplified for all employees
Owner: Corporate Secretary
Participants: Corporate Secretary, CHRO, all managers and above, Board
Source: workflow W1734 — Conflict of Interest Disclosure &amp; Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1734_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1734_Lane1" name="Corporate Secretary">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1734_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1734_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1734_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
